cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fdo-3d-packager"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this
  file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Florian
    family-names: Thiery
    affiliation: Research Squirrel Engineers Network
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3246-3531"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FDOx-squirrel/fdo-3d-packager"
abstract: >-
  Packages a 3D model -- from Sketchfab or a local file -- into a FAIR
  Digital Object (fdo:3DDataFDO) ready for ingest by fdo-squirrel: Blender
  conversion, Nexus multiresolution build, MD.cff/CITATION.cff, and a bundle
  ZIP in fdo-squirrel's expected layout.
keywords:
  - FAIR Digital Object
  - 3D data
  - cultural heritage
  - photogrammetry
license: MIT
version: v0.1
date-released: "2026-09-03"
